      "writtenOn": "2022-10-19T18:46:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Another question this brings up -- how do we expect clients to populate / get a TextureInfo object to pass in here? Does that have to be handled on a per-backend basis via backend-specific (e.g. MtlTextureInfo) constructors?",
      "parentUuid": "d4ae6735_987b8b0b",
